<title>Singapore: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Oct 28.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Oct 28.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   112/114   117/119     UNQ     221/222</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  117/119   122/124   223/228   234/238</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunkers edged higher on firm cargo and swaps levels, traders said on Monday. Demand was average, they said. A 2,000-tonne parcel of 380 cst was traded at $117.75 per tonne, a trader said. MDO and gas oil prices were steady.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsoom (65-870-3082).</p>
</text>
